ublestrike 1%</a>:</b> Passive: 1% <a href=\"/page/Quality_bonus\" title=\"Quality bonus\">Quality bonus</a> to Doublestrike. (Doublestrike is a chance to score an additional hit with a melee attack.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Diversion\" title=\"Diversion\">Quality  Diversion +2%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Diversion\" title=\"Diversion\">Quality  Diversion +2%</a>:</b> +2% <a href=\"/page/Quality_bonus\" title=\"Quality bonus\">Quality bonus</a> to decreased threat generated from melee damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Deadly\" title=\"Deadly\"> Deadly +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Deadly\" title=\"Deadly\"> Deadly +6</a>:</b> +6 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to weapon damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#